ited (rule 16).\n28:   deliverables:\n29:   - coordination/goals/GOAL-ECDLP-bbc21f/batches/BATCH-12ee85/reviews/TASK-20260910-59d885/red-team-report.yaml\n30:   artifact_paths:\n31:   - coordination/goals/GOAL-ECDLP-bbc21f/batches/BATCH-12ee85/reviews/TASK-20260910-59d885/red-team-report.yaml\n32:   archived_by: TASK-20260910-4abecd\n33:   write_scope:\n34:   - coordination/goals/GOAL-ECDLP-bbc21f/batches/BATCH-12ee85/reviews/TASK-20260910-59d885\n35:   inference:\n36:     policy: review-adversarial\n37:     reasoning_effort: null\n38:     fallback_allowed: true\n39:     degraded_allowed: false\n40:     independent_session_required: true\n41:   budget:\n42:     wall_clock_seconds: 5400\n43:     memory_gb: 4\n44:     maximum_runs: null\n45:   completion_gate:\n46:   - Per-object outcomes with named broken steps for all four declared objects plus any added; observations\n47:     only.\n48:   review_plan: coordination/goals/GOAL-ECDLP-bbc21f/batches/BATCH-12ee85/review-plan.yaml\n\n(End of file - total 48 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"handoff:\n  id: TASK-20260910-59d885\n  recorded_at: '2026-09-10'\n  goal_id: GOAL-ECDLP-bbc21f\n  question_id: RQ-ECDLP-78dbc5\n  batch_id: BATCH-12ee85\n  dispatch_queue: coordination/goals/GOAL-ECDLP-bbc21f/batches/BATCH-12ee85/dispatch_queue.json\n  task_card: coordination/goals/GOAL-ECDLP-bbc21f/batches/BATCH-12ee85/dispatch_queue.json#TASK-20260910-59d885\n  role: red-team\n  from: coordinator\n  to: red-team\n  review_required: false\n  objective: Attack the candidate interpretations of the Stage A''/B'' comparison; run the four declared\n    proves-too-much objects plus your own.\n  uncertainty_reduced: Attack the candidate interpretations of the Stage A''/B'' comparison; run the four\n    declared proves-too-much objects plus your own.\n  inputs:\n  - coordination/goals/GOAL-ECDLP-bbc21f/batches/BATCH-12ee85/review-plan.yaml\n  - coordination/goals/GOAL-ECDLP-bbc21f/batches/BATCH-12ee85/reviews/TASK-20260910-19bd7b\n