 \"quantity.md\", \"deliverables.md\", \"prohibitions.md\"],\n28:   \"complete_list_claim\": \"This is the COMPLETE list of every file read before the seal below existed. No specification.yaml, specification.v3.yaml, amendment file, decision record, handoff, task card, dispatch queue, evidence record, run directory, prior implementation, knowledge/docs/inputs file, or git-history-printing command (log/show/blame/diff) was read or run at any point before sealing.\",\n29:   \"non_content_filesystem_operations_before_seal\": [\n30:     \"ls on coordination/goals/GOAL-ECDLP-bbc21f/batches/ and .../BATCH-4433c1/ and .../BATCH-4433c1/reviews/TASK-20260907-7afa98/ -- directory-listing only, to locate/create the write target; no file content under these paths was opened, read, or inspected\",\n31:     \"mkdir -p on my own new task directory\",\n32:     \"sha256sum on the four packet files themselves, after already having read their full content via the Read tool -- a fingerprint of bytes already read, not new information\"\n33:   ],\n34:   \"slip_occurred\": false,\n35:   \"slip_disclosure\": \"None. No read outside the four-file allowlist occurred before this seal existed. All development, testing, and validation of the instrument (including a brute-force cross-check on synthetic tiny-N graphs and a check of W/cap/dp_threshold arithmetic against quantity.md's own printed table) used only definitions and parameters stated in quantity.md; no external or prior implementation was consulted, and none exists in the paths this session touched.\",\n36:   \"session_provenance\": \"This session was launched fresh for this task and has no memory of EXP-ECDLP-6ac801, PA-ECDLP-6ac801-v2-to-v3, or any related decision/correction. It authored neither the contract, nor the amendment, nor this derivation packet.\"\n37: }\n\n(End of file - total 37 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"task_id\": \"TASK-20260907-7afa98\",\n  \"batch\": \"BATCH-4433c1\",\n  \"for_derivation_packe