ith CI and model beside (RUN-ECDLP-869870-024 constants\n366:     table) but V1 failed at 2^24 and every constant from 2^24 upward\n367:     carries the rule-3 invalid-for-interpretation label; C2 closes only\n368:     after the re-keyed fixture cell validates the instrument. C3: MET on\n369:     the verified commit for the T/2 cell at a = 1/4 -- EV-ECDLP-60e266\n370:     carries a complete measured obstruction block (quantities, values with\n371:     CIs, measured_by run ids, scope, resource_check examined true with\n372:     three readings); it closes nothing beyond that scope and does not close\n373:     RQ-ECDLP-78dbc5.\n374:   batch_9c5410_disposition: >-\n375:     approve_experiment, closed by TASK-20260906-2d30dd. BATCH-9c5410 was the\n376:     approval gate with zero execution: the user answered \"Approve both as\n377:     frozen (Recommended)\" on 2026-09-06 (re-affirmed \"Approved\" in chat the\n378:     same day), recorded verbatim in DEC-20260906-2b1387; EXP-ECDLP-612fb1 and\n379:     EXP-ECDLP-869870 are approved at version 1 (five gate fields only) with\n380:     executor handoffs TASK-20260906-3623b9 and TASK-20260906-d17254 written.\n381:     No run exists; H-ECDLP-37dc01 and H-ECDLP-3550b8 stay `specified`; C1,\n382:     C2, C3 stay OPEN.\n383:   latest_verified_commit: bc48281293f0a8adc7f806e6d4c1d95bcc7d5073\n384:   latest_verified_commit_note_20260907_48ef8b: >-\n385:     ADVANCED by TASK-20260907-1aa16f from f996864d2613d2fae9c397191cb0de49ba8449cd\n386:     (BATCH-e9fd22's gate ledger archive, whose note is preserved verbatim below)\n387:     to bc48281293f0a8adc7f806e6d4c1d95bcc7d5073 -- TASK-20260907-3edbf0's ledger\n388:     archive of the approval-gate decision DEC-20260907-adbe7e, parent\n389:     4e737c70e646fda9de388c883fcae00b2148d6d2, base origin/main checked at\n390:     e6059f4de563be3cb1f1b25383782ab9a708352f and MERGED at 4e737c70e (never\n391:     rebased), clean, with no conflict in any ledger record, run artifact or\n392:     knowledge entry, so no superseding record was needed. Its receipt is\n393:     coordination/goals/GOAL-ECDLP-bbc21f/batches/BATCH-48ef8b/archives/TASK-20260907-3edbf0/ledger-receipt.json\n394:     (committed sha256\n395:     871541a2d99c64e6be5dd937c65ef3bee60af1ee394942c848c4f07cbe15e881), its four\n396:     declared `path_sha256` entries are content-verified against the tree, and\n397:     after the queue backfill at 09c2e702b `tools/research_dispatch.py --claims\n398:     refs` reports `completed_archive_commits_verified: passed`. THIS LANE'S\n399:     TERMINAL ARCHIVE COMMIT IS NOT NAMED HERE, for the same reason ceb8cf's\n400:     receipt could not name its own: this field is written INSIDE that commit, so\n401:     a value pointing at it would have to hash itself. It is recorded in\n402:     TASK-20260907-38f086's receipt and in the queue's archive block, and the next\n403:     lane advances this field past it.\n404:   latest_verified_commit_note_20260907_e9fd22: >-\n405:     ADVANCED by TASK-20260907-9e7580 from a97ac6e23f82ab608bce801507e028a2841a7bb4\n406:     (BATCH-f3a30a's verified follow-up, preserved verbatim in\n407:     `latest_verified_commit_note` below) to\n408:     f996864d2613d2fae9c397191cb0de49ba8449cd -- TASK-20260907-ceb8cf's ledger\n409:     archive of DEC-20260907-4e34c5, parent 475ca4419c6d1ac2ae572ef4512b25402b16dfc9,\n410:     base origin/main checked at 1d7bdff902cf3091b1e6ba54b4b49e778e514cd7 and\n411:     MERGED (never rebased). Its receipt is\n412:     coordination/goals/GOAL-ECDLP-bbc21f/batches/BATCH-e9fd22/archives/TASK-20260907-ceb8cf/ledger-receipt.json\n413:     (committed sha256 f022501063eb9fed619b8f80bcd229bed69f4fc1b3a1b27d58a6f29a87ce1180),\n414:     whose four declared `path_sha256` entries are content-verified against the\n415:     tree; its queue archive block carries `commit_sha: null` by construction\n416:     and is backfilled in this close's own separate follow-up commit, after\n417:     which `tools/research_dispatch.py --claims refs` reports\n418:     `completed_archive_commits_verified: passed`. THIS CLOSE'S OWN TWO COMMITS\n419:     ARE NOT NAMED HERE, for the same reason ceb8cf's receipt could not name\n420:     its own: this field is written inside the first of them, so a value\n421:     pointing at it would have to hash itself. The next lane advances this\n422:     field past them.\n423:   latest_verified_commit_note: >-\n424:     Advanced by the orchestrating session to BATCH-f3a30a's ledger archive\n425:     verified follow-up commit (TASK-20260906-ae5bb4's read_scope fix,\n426:     a97ac6e23f82ab608bce801507e028a2841a7bb4), after\n427:     `tools/research_dispatch.py` reported `completed_archive_commits_verified:\n428:     passed` and all 5 BATCH-f3a30a tasks terminal/completed. The ledger\n429:     archive's own content commit is a10b39329463dca6e30c09358d5d282bc7bc715e\n430:     (backfilled at d87b9f68a). Previous value (TASK-20260906-aa3dd2,\n431:     preserved above the arrow): eaae31a0fc6c3a55fee3ea171afc3e98e9a1862d,\n432:     the BATCH-252a44 approval-authorship ledger commit.\n433:     Further note (TASK-20260906-773a2e, this authorship, coordinator role\n434:     without a shell): this value is likewise NOT advanced here. The\n435:     orchestrating session advances it to this batch's (BATCH-252a44)\n436:     ledger-archive commit in its own separate, verified follow-up commit\n437:     after the post-commit verifier accepts DEC-20260906-806501 and this\n438:     goal-head update, exactly as it did for BATCH-9c5410 and BATCH-289698.\n439:   completion_criteria:\n440:   - id: C1\n441:     statement: >-\n442:       A committed evidence record for EXP-ECDLP-612fb1, independently\n443:       validated and red-teamed, reporting T_resel(U)/T_static at fixed\n444:       (L, epsilon) at a = 1/4 with a confidence interval, the early-batch\n445:       penalty (first 10% of the batch, U_ss and cumulative U*), and the\n446:       outcomes of the NULL-A / NULL-B nulls and