napshot 9e6396c35e). No run and no reading of this round existed when this plan\n    was written.'\n  claim_under_review: 'Two independent measurement packages, both observations only. (1) Stage A'''':\n    the blind re-derivation seal of TASK-20260907-7afa98 (seal.json hash set + UTC stamp declared before\n    any non-packet read; reading_attestation.json; instrument.py, run_full.py, cells.jsonl, summary.json,\n    run.log), per-cell k_25 verdicts and bootstrap CIs over the full (N, a) grid: a=1/16 G3-FEASIBLE at\n    both scales (25/25, margin +0.0187/+0.0216), a=1/8 borderline (N=2^20 k_25=16, margin +0.0043 CI [-0.0002,+0.0087]","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Volumes/SSD990/llm/tmp/opencode/ecdlp-20260910/coordination/goals/GOAL-ECDLP-bbc21f/batches/BATCH-12ee85/review-plan.yaml","text":"review_plan:\n  id: REVIEW-PLAN-BATCH-12ee85\n  recorded_at: '2026-09-10'\n  goal_id: GOAL-ECDLP-bbc21f\n  question_id: RQ-ECDLP-78dbc5\n  batch_id: BATCH-12ee85\n  experiment_id: EXP-ECDLP-6ac801\n  hypothesis_id: H-ECDLP-37dc01\n  written_by: coordinator-ecdlp-20260910\n  authority: 'Opened under the standing user authorization of 2026-09-06 and the approved v3 chain: EXP-ECDLP-6ac801\n    v3 approved by the independent gate DEC-20260907-b4f2a9 (gate task TASK-20260907-e17c05), which names\n    as its RANK 1 exactly this round''s subject matter: dispatch and then review Stage A'''' (the blind\n    re-derivation seal, executed and snapshotted under BATCH-4433c1) and the Stage B'''' production grid\n    (50 runs, 200 cells, snapshot 9e6396c35e). No run and no reading of this round existed when this plan\n    was written.'\n  claim_under_review: 'Two independent measurement packages, both observations only. (1) Stage A'''':\n    the blind re-derivation seal of TASK-20260907-7afa98 (seal.json hash set + UTC stamp declared before\n    any non-packet read; reading_attestation.json; instrument.py, run_full.py, cells.jsonl, summary.json,\n    run.log),